WEBVTT

00:05.964 --> 00:08.258
[theme music]

00:35.660 --> 00:36.578
[crow cawing]

00:40.999 --> 00:43.126
[crow cawing]

00:46.212 --> 00:49.507
[Master Lee] Daeho once suffered
a long, unprecedented drought.

00:52.802 --> 00:54.721
It was so severe that it caused

00:54.804 --> 00:57.515
Lake Gyeongcheondaeho
to dry up completely.

00:57.599 --> 00:59.684
[crow cawing]

00:59.768 --> 01:01.770
[tense music]

01:03.938 --> 01:06.524
To fill the lake back up with energy,

01:06.608 --> 01:09.652
the mages of Daeho performed a grand rite.

01:15.241 --> 01:18.661
Enormous hailstones began
to fall from the sky.

01:30.006 --> 01:32.258
But among the hailstones
that fell that day,

01:32.342 --> 01:34.719
there was one that did not melt.

01:36.638 --> 01:41.559
That piece of unmelted ice
turned into fire,

01:42.227 --> 01:43.520
then into stone,

01:44.020 --> 01:46.064
and finally water,

01:46.773 --> 01:50.235
before returning to its original ice form.

01:51.069 --> 01:53.780
In that process,
it produced a black powder

01:55.156 --> 01:59.869
known as the Soul Ejector,
used for the alchemy of souls.

01:59.953 --> 02:01.621
[mages grunting]

02:02.163 --> 02:03.706
[screaming]

02:03.790 --> 02:06.251
The power of the Soul Ejector
was astonishing.

02:07.919 --> 02:11.798
It summoned the soul back into
its dead body to bring it back to life.

02:12.382 --> 02:15.301
Exchanged the souls of two bodies.

02:17.178 --> 02:22.100
Sucked the souls out of living people
and stole their energy.

02:28.231 --> 02:30.567
And eventually, that astonishing power

02:31.317 --> 02:32.819
brought forth chaos.

02:33.862 --> 02:35.864
[dramatic music]

02:41.995 --> 02:44.122
In order to possess
the never-melting ice stone

02:44.205 --> 02:46.082
that produced the Soul Ejector,

02:46.875 --> 02:51.671
the mages fought a bloody war,
turning Daeho into a living hell.

03:00.930 --> 03:02.765
The man who ended that long war…

03:05.310 --> 03:09.314
was the founder of Songrim,
Master Seo Gyeong.

03:19.073 --> 03:20.867
And he taught me everything.

03:20.950 --> 03:23.620
[girl] So the ice stone is
an amazing thing.

03:23.703 --> 03:26.664
So where is it? I want to see it.

03:26.748 --> 03:29.292
It is an extremely frightening stone.

03:29.375 --> 03:31.711
The sorcery performed with its power

03:31.794 --> 03:34.797
also created strange objects
that hurt people.

03:35.632 --> 03:38.092
Child, where did you get that doll?

03:38.635 --> 03:40.511
I found it in the mountains.

03:44.265 --> 03:46.392
Would you trade it for these chestnuts?

03:46.976 --> 03:47.852
[boy] Yeah!

03:48.770 --> 03:49.604
Hmm.

03:56.027 --> 03:59.113
This is not just an ordinary toy,
it's a cursed relic.

04:00.990 --> 04:01.824
[relic cracking]

04:06.996 --> 04:08.164
[boy, girl] Wow!

04:08.248 --> 04:09.582
[both] What was that?

04:09.666 --> 04:12.710
These are dangerous things created
by powerful sorcery.

04:12.794 --> 04:15.630
Oh, I know.
They're called relics, aren't they?

04:16.256 --> 04:17.465
They're at Jinyowon.

04:17.548 --> 04:18.383
[chuckles]

04:19.133 --> 04:19.968
Yeah.

04:20.468 --> 04:23.304
In Jinyowon, there're even
more dangerous relics.

04:24.639 --> 04:27.767
[Master Lee] Many strange items made
with the power of the ice stone

04:27.850 --> 04:29.185
are locked away there.

04:36.192 --> 04:40.613
And there they stay, waiting for a chance
to come out into the world again.

04:54.252 --> 04:55.253
[Go Won] Should I take you in?

04:56.629 --> 04:57.547
[Mu-deok] No, sir.

04:58.965 --> 05:01.592
Although I may be a filthy girl
avoided by everyone,

05:02.302 --> 05:05.138
I refuse to serve just anyone,
Your Royal Highness.

05:05.221 --> 05:07.390
[sighs] That rude girl.

05:08.308 --> 05:09.892
She should have just said
"I would be honored".

05:09.976 --> 05:14.230
The scent of cinnamon in this batch
of cinnamon and ginger wine is excellent.

05:14.314 --> 05:15.940
[Mu-deok] Oh, goodness.
Thank you so much, Your Highness.

05:16.524 --> 05:17.567
[sniffs]

05:18.985 --> 05:20.486
Smells just like cinnamon.

05:21.112 --> 05:21.946
[scoffs]

05:24.282 --> 05:25.533
Insolent girl.

05:25.616 --> 05:27.118
Is something amiss, Your Royal Highness?

05:27.201 --> 05:29.912
Filthy Mu-deok got her filth on me.

05:30.496 --> 05:31.789
The stench will not go away.

05:32.415 --> 05:34.917
[sniffs] But you smell wonderful.

05:37.420 --> 05:38.338
[sighs]

05:38.421 --> 05:39.839
Enough. Leave.

05:40.882 --> 05:41.841
I said "Leave"!

05:41.924 --> 05:43.051
Yes, Your Highness.

05:47.597 --> 05:48.473
[door opens]

05:49.932 --> 05:50.767
[door closes]

05:50.850 --> 05:53.352
I saved her, rescued her,

05:53.936 --> 05:56.439
gave her my sachet and a silk dress.

06:04.739 --> 06:05.907
Ungrateful girl.

06:08.493 --> 06:09.952
[ominous music]

06:11.037 --> 06:13.206
- [mirror Mu-deok] I am honored.
- Did I not tell you to…

06:20.379 --> 06:21.339
Filthy Mu-deok?

06:21.839 --> 06:23.216
How did you get in here?

06:24.467 --> 06:27.303
I have that sachet that you bestowed
upon me, Your Royal Highness.

06:28.930 --> 06:32.266
Well, I suppose you need something again.

06:32.350 --> 06:34.852
I know you have been
thinking about me, Your Highness,

06:34.936 --> 06:36.104
so I came to see you.

06:36.187 --> 06:38.314
Are you saying you know
how to read my mind?

06:41.818 --> 06:42.860
Well, good then.

06:44.237 --> 06:48.282
While you're here, have a glass
of very strong cinnamon and ginger wine.

06:56.207 --> 06:57.333
Mm.

06:57.416 --> 06:59.544
It does smell really wonderful.

07:01.379 --> 07:02.421
It does?

07:05.383 --> 07:06.634
[exhales]

07:06.717 --> 07:09.804
I must say, I really do like this place.

07:12.306 --> 07:14.976
If you continue to think of me
just as you did today,

07:15.059 --> 07:17.812
Your Royal Highness,
I will come and visit you.

07:24.944 --> 07:25.778
[chuckles]

07:30.199 --> 07:32.243
The palace is indeed great.

07:35.997 --> 07:37.331
Do you know why…

07:39.500 --> 07:41.919
I continue to think about you here…

07:44.005 --> 07:46.466
in this place of soft silk, confined wine?

07:50.470 --> 07:52.138
You're Filthy Mu-deok.

07:55.183 --> 07:57.268
But at this moment,
you do not reek of filth.

07:58.769 --> 08:00.688
[gasps]
Highness.

08:00.771 --> 08:01.647
Who are you?

08:01.731 --> 08:03.816
[suspenseful music]

08:07.737 --> 08:08.571
Ah.

08:11.324 --> 08:12.366
You caught me.

08:17.830 --> 08:20.541
[dramatic music intensifies]

08:23.920 --> 08:25.087
[door opens]

08:26.589 --> 08:28.216
Something wicked was in here.

08:28.299 --> 08:30.343
- Search the place.
- [female mages] Yes, Your Highness.

08:34.847 --> 08:36.682
Why did it appear as that girl?

08:44.857 --> 08:46.901
- [Ho-gyeong] Search every corner.
- [female mages] Yes.

08:51.531 --> 08:53.241
The Crown Prince is here, my lady.

08:53.991 --> 08:54.825
The Crown Prince?

09:02.500 --> 09:03.960
I've come looking for someone.

09:04.043 --> 09:05.795
I was told I could find her here.

09:07.421 --> 09:10.466
Is something going on?
I heard a ruckus.

09:11.050 --> 09:14.303
A servant caused trouble and disappeared,
so we were looking for her.

09:14.387 --> 09:15.388
A servant?

09:15.471 --> 09:17.223
She's not of our household.

09:17.306 --> 09:19.475
She serves the Jang family. Mu-deok.

09:19.559 --> 09:21.185
She's the very one I'm here for.

09:22.186 --> 09:23.729
Did something happen with her?

09:25.648 --> 09:26.482
That servant…

09:27.942 --> 09:30.778
broke the yin-yang jade
that was meant to be used to make…

09:31.529 --> 09:32.822
my wedding rings.

09:37.660 --> 09:39.287
[Cho-yeon] I told you to be careful.

09:39.829 --> 09:41.163
What will you do about this?

09:41.872 --> 09:43.082
I'm very sorry, my lady.

09:43.708 --> 09:44.959
Please, spare me!

09:45.501 --> 09:46.877
I will summon her master.

09:47.378 --> 09:49.463
For now, take her
and lock her up in the annex.

09:51.340 --> 09:52.508
[breathes heavily]

09:52.592 --> 09:53.593
Please, spare me!

09:53.676 --> 09:54.552
[Mu-deok] I am sorry!

09:55.553 --> 09:57.513
[Cho-yeon] Perhaps she was
scared of being punished.

09:57.597 --> 10:01.058
But while she was locked up,
she stole the broken jade and ran away.

10:05.313 --> 10:07.356
Seeing as we still have not found her,

10:07.440 --> 10:10.276
it seems that she already made her escape.

10:12.236 --> 10:13.738
She got scared and ran away?

10:14.780 --> 10:16.115
A bold girl like her?

10:18.993 --> 10:20.745
Mages from Jeongjingak are here.

10:22.371 --> 10:23.789
[footsteps approaching]

10:29.170 --> 10:32.173
What… brings you here, Your Highness?

10:32.256 --> 10:33.841
What brings you here, Yul?

10:34.425 --> 10:35.426
I'm looking for someone.

10:36.469 --> 10:38.971
Are you… also looking for Mu-deok?

10:39.680 --> 10:40.514
Yes.

10:41.766 --> 10:42.975
I am looking for Mu-deok.

10:44.477 --> 10:46.562
[pensive music]

10:51.150 --> 10:53.194
[Cho-yeon] She broke the yin-yang jade,

10:53.277 --> 10:55.571
and then ran away with it
to avoid punishment.

10:56.322 --> 10:59.283
[Dang-gu] But why did you not
have the wedding rings made?

11:00.326 --> 11:03.996
I went to Chwiseonru to lend you my hand,
but they said you left in a hurry.

11:05.247 --> 11:06.082
[gasps]

11:06.165 --> 11:08.459
I… I just postponed it.

11:10.711 --> 11:12.421
Yul, why are you looking for Mu-deok?

11:13.047 --> 11:16.592
I, too, saw the illusion that you did,
Your Royal Highness.

11:36.695 --> 11:38.322
How did you come into Songrim?

11:41.158 --> 11:43.494
I came because you kept thinking of me.

11:46.872 --> 11:47.915
What do you mean?

11:49.417 --> 11:51.502
You were longing for
the one you met at Danhyanggok.

11:51.585 --> 11:53.087
Stop fooling around.

11:53.170 --> 11:54.296
What do you mean "longing"?

11:55.172 --> 11:57.007
- I would never.
- You are lying.

11:57.091 --> 11:58.926
You still have
the whistle with you, right?

12:03.431 --> 12:05.766
You barely noticed the pain in your leg.

12:06.767 --> 12:08.853
And you were not scared to be scolded.

12:11.063 --> 12:12.898
Because you liked me so much.

12:18.863 --> 12:20.281
If you keep thinking of me…

12:28.747 --> 12:30.082
I will visit you.

12:34.879 --> 12:36.005
[gasps]

12:36.088 --> 12:36.922
You are…

12:37.923 --> 12:38.966
You cannot be human.

12:50.102 --> 12:51.353
You're getting rid of me?

12:53.481 --> 12:55.232
Then you'll never see me again.

12:58.694 --> 12:59.570
[inhales deeply]

13:06.452 --> 13:08.245
[soft music]

13:17.588 --> 13:18.589
[mirror shatters]

13:26.472 --> 13:28.390
It wasn't her. It was an illusion.

13:29.975 --> 13:32.645
Then, does that mean
what I saw was also an illusion?

13:32.728 --> 13:35.523
It was odd, so I went to
Chwiseonru to find her.

13:36.106 --> 13:38.442
And they told me
that she was dragged here.

13:38.526 --> 13:41.111
She wasn't dragged.
She was here to run an errand.

13:41.904 --> 13:44.532
And she's disappeared
with the precious treasure.

13:45.366 --> 13:48.118
We're not in search of an illusion,
we're in search of a thief.

13:49.662 --> 13:51.664
[tense music]

13:53.791 --> 13:54.917
Here comes her master, now.

14:10.474 --> 14:13.352
Is Master Lee not here today, either?

14:13.852 --> 14:16.146
He's always been the wandering sort.

14:16.855 --> 14:18.357
He brought this dog and left.

14:19.108 --> 14:22.069
Was this Gwigu also made
from the ice stone?

14:22.152 --> 14:25.906
Master Seo Gyeong made it
with the energy from the ice stone

14:25.990 --> 14:28.158
to sniff out traces of sorcery.

14:29.285 --> 14:31.453
Uk broke Gwigu's pottery,

14:31.537 --> 14:34.999
so Master Lee
brought the spirit from Jinyowon

14:35.666 --> 14:37.334
and put it inside this little dog.

14:37.418 --> 14:40.713
And you're sure you really do not know
where Master Seo Gyeong…

14:41.881 --> 14:43.132
sealed the ice stone, either?

14:43.215 --> 14:44.049
Hmm.

14:45.009 --> 14:45.968
I do not.

14:46.468 --> 14:49.680
You think the alchemy of souls
started again because someone

14:49.763 --> 14:52.099
has managed to unseal the ice stone?

14:53.767 --> 14:56.854
The only way to shift souls
without first mastering Hwansu

14:57.730 --> 14:59.231
is to use the ice stone.

14:59.773 --> 15:02.610
I'm quite certain that
someone has unsealed it

15:03.235 --> 15:04.778
and brought it into the world again.

15:06.322 --> 15:08.073
If so, it's a disaster.

15:08.157 --> 15:12.286
We must not repeat
the chaos of two centuries ago.

15:13.954 --> 15:17.082
We must find the ice stone,
no matter what it takes.

15:26.759 --> 15:28.928
I was given orders to give this to you.

15:39.355 --> 15:42.274
I thought you were going
to lie low for a while.

15:42.358 --> 15:45.611
Are you planning
to shift another soul, then?

15:49.531 --> 15:51.158
Tell them that I received this.

15:51.700 --> 15:53.202
[chuckles]
Yes.

16:00.209 --> 16:02.628
Hurry up and find a eunuch
who can replace him.

16:05.047 --> 16:08.759
You will be shifted into that body,
so choose wisely, Gil-ju.

16:08.842 --> 16:09.677
Yes.

16:11.053 --> 16:15.265
[Gil-ju] I did not serve the Danju
just to shift into a body of a eunuch.

16:17.351 --> 16:18.602
If I use Naksu,

16:19.937 --> 16:21.855
I can get the body I want.

16:30.990 --> 16:33.617
My servant has committed
a grave sin against you.

16:33.701 --> 16:35.869
As her master, I'm fully to blame.

16:36.996 --> 16:38.163
And I apologize.

16:41.500 --> 16:45.087
You must be upset to lose the jade
that was meant for the wedding rings.

16:46.296 --> 16:48.632
I begged my mother for that yin-yang jade.

16:48.716 --> 16:49.675
[sighs]

16:49.758 --> 16:51.593
They say that
if your rings are made with it,

16:51.677 --> 16:53.220
you will grow old together.

16:54.805 --> 16:56.181
But it is broken now.

16:56.265 --> 16:58.434
I did not know
it held such a deep meaning.

16:59.226 --> 17:00.894
I must say, I'm upset as well.

17:02.271 --> 17:04.481
We will find you a more valuable jade

17:04.565 --> 17:06.483
which you can use
to help make your wedding rings.

17:09.236 --> 17:11.864
Since your apology is sincere,
I will accept it.

17:12.489 --> 17:14.658
- You may all leave now.
- Thank you.

17:14.742 --> 17:15.659
I cannot do that.

17:17.953 --> 17:19.204
I need to find Mu-deok.

17:22.082 --> 17:24.418
I won't rest
until we catch that wicked servant

17:24.918 --> 17:27.129
and recover the yin-yang jade
for you as well.

17:27.963 --> 17:31.884
She's weak and, uh, has short legs,
so she will not have gone far.

17:33.010 --> 17:36.346
Please, permit me to stay
so I can look for her.

17:40.976 --> 17:42.311
Go ahead if you must.

17:43.228 --> 17:44.271
[Jang Uk] Thank you, my lady.

17:44.938 --> 17:48.275
Now that I have your permission,
would you please open it?

17:50.569 --> 17:52.362
The place of relics and artifacts.

17:53.363 --> 17:54.990
Open the door to Jinyowon.

18:00.037 --> 18:03.165
[dramatic music playing]

18:14.676 --> 18:18.097
[Ho-gyeong] Jinyowon can only be opened
by a member of the Jin family.

18:18.180 --> 18:22.142
Right now, Cho-yeon and I
are the only ones who can open this door.

18:23.060 --> 18:25.062
It's impossible that she's in there.

18:25.145 --> 18:26.647
I'm sure I saw Mu-deok's illusion.

18:29.525 --> 18:31.026
Perhaps you were seeing things.

18:31.985 --> 18:34.988
How can you be sure
the illusion was created by a relic?

18:35.072 --> 18:36.031
I saw it, too.

18:37.950 --> 18:39.785
I'm certain it was an illusion
in Mu-deok's form.

18:41.745 --> 18:43.747
All the relics with the power
to create illusions

18:43.831 --> 18:45.374
should be inside Jinyowon, are they not?

18:45.457 --> 18:47.167
Please, let me go inside and check.

18:47.709 --> 18:49.920
Very well. I will open the door.

18:51.463 --> 18:55.259
However, this place is filled
with dangerous relics and artifacts.

18:56.677 --> 18:58.846
You could become possessed
and trapped inside.

19:00.222 --> 19:02.641
Young Master, it's too dangerous.

19:03.892 --> 19:05.227
[Seo Yul] I will go with him.

19:07.771 --> 19:08.647
[exhales relievedly]

19:09.273 --> 19:10.274
I'll go as well.

19:15.320 --> 19:16.321
It sounds fun.

19:16.947 --> 19:19.449
When will I get
another chance to see inside?

19:19.533 --> 19:21.785
[cheeky music]

19:21.869 --> 19:22.828
[sighs]

19:23.829 --> 19:26.039
[tense music]

19:43.765 --> 19:45.184
Go on inside.

19:45.267 --> 19:46.810
I'll give you no more than an hour.

20:02.159 --> 20:03.952
We should inform the leader.

20:07.998 --> 20:09.082
[Jang Uk] Mu-deok.

20:10.000 --> 20:11.210
Mu-deok!

20:15.881 --> 20:17.841
[Go Won] Hmm, so this is Jinyowon.

20:19.635 --> 20:21.762
They say every item
in here is so precious,

20:21.845 --> 20:23.764
they cannot be bought with money.

20:23.847 --> 20:26.225
Will you please be quiet?
We are not on tour.

20:26.308 --> 20:27.351
[scoffs]

20:27.434 --> 20:29.061
Are these all yours?

20:29.728 --> 20:33.273
Well, I suppose if you marry
into the Jin family, they will be.

20:33.857 --> 20:35.651
- [scoffs]
- I envy you.

20:35.734 --> 20:38.362
All of these treasures
will become yours, Jin Uk.

20:39.363 --> 20:40.948
If you're so envious,

20:41.031 --> 20:42.658
you can get married instead,
Your Highness.

20:43.450 --> 20:45.077
But even if it all was yours,

20:45.160 --> 20:46.995
how could you touch them
when you're so scared?

20:47.079 --> 20:48.330
You're not even good at spells.

20:48.413 --> 20:50.749
You think your spells are powerful enough
to touch anything?

20:51.625 --> 20:54.628
Well, Lady Jin told us
not to touch anything.

20:54.711 --> 20:57.714
What an excuse!
You're just too scared to touch them.

20:57.798 --> 20:58.674
[scoffs]

21:01.551 --> 21:02.803
- [artifact roars]
- [Go Won yelps]

21:04.221 --> 21:05.055
What was that?

21:05.138 --> 21:06.181
What was that?

21:08.475 --> 21:09.434
Is everyone all right?

21:10.102 --> 21:11.603
[Go Won] It seems
there's something odd in there.

21:12.646 --> 21:14.189
Were you not startled?

21:15.440 --> 21:16.775
I was startled.

21:17.943 --> 21:19.778
Be careful in the dark, Your Highness.

21:21.905 --> 21:22.781
[Jang Uk sighs]

21:22.864 --> 21:24.283
Was he really startled?

21:24.366 --> 21:26.868
Yes. When he's startled,
he loses his sense of direction.

21:26.952 --> 21:28.787
Yul, not that way! Hey!

21:28.870 --> 21:30.831
Goodness, we… we have to go the other way.

21:31.581 --> 21:33.625
[Go Won] Go that way. That way.

21:38.088 --> 21:39.548
Let us all try to be careful.

21:42.801 --> 21:44.177
So even cool-headed Seo Yul

21:44.886 --> 21:47.347
loses his way when he is startled.

21:47.931 --> 21:48.849
Indeed.

21:54.688 --> 21:56.189
Uh, be careful, Your Highness.

21:57.441 --> 21:58.692
Careful yourself.

22:00.277 --> 22:01.611
Let us stick together.

22:06.491 --> 22:08.493
[suspenseful music]

22:37.939 --> 22:40.150
[sighs]
How did I get stuck here?

22:50.994 --> 22:52.079
[sighs]

22:52.162 --> 22:53.538
I should have held it in.

22:55.373 --> 22:57.375
I should never have provoked that girl.

22:59.336 --> 23:00.879
[Cho-yeon] I told you to be careful.

23:00.962 --> 23:04.007
Wait here.
Young Master Jang will be here soon.

23:04.591 --> 23:07.219
My lady, what's going to happen to me?

23:07.302 --> 23:10.388
What do you think?
You'll be severely punished.

23:11.181 --> 23:12.557
I'm not worried about that.

23:13.517 --> 23:14.684
They say that if you break the jade,

23:14.768 --> 23:19.064
the rest of your relationships
with lovers are destined to break, too.

23:21.108 --> 23:22.484
What am I going to do now?

23:24.236 --> 23:25.987
What are you talking about?

23:26.071 --> 23:27.989
Stop talking such nonsense.

23:28.532 --> 23:30.200
If you break that yin-yang jade,

23:30.283 --> 23:33.411
they say that you'll never ever
end up with the person you love.

23:34.037 --> 23:36.915
That's what all the gisaengs
at Chwiseonru are saying.

23:36.998 --> 23:38.166
Is…

23:38.250 --> 23:39.501
Is that really true?

23:39.584 --> 23:40.418
Yes.

23:41.378 --> 23:45.173
Did you not know that already,
Young Lady Jin?

23:45.799 --> 23:47.300
That cannot be.

23:49.719 --> 23:51.304
Then what's going to happen to me?

23:52.180 --> 23:53.181
[sighs]

23:55.225 --> 23:56.893
Why are you worried, my lady,

23:57.602 --> 23:59.354
when I was the one who broke it?

24:03.942 --> 24:05.819
It was you who broke the jade, wasn't it?

24:06.695 --> 24:09.781
And you made me carry the box
so that you could place the blame on me.

24:10.657 --> 24:11.616
Am I right?

24:12.868 --> 24:14.911
If you felt wronged,
you should have said so

24:14.995 --> 24:17.038
in front of my mother
when you had the chance.

24:17.122 --> 24:19.541
Would Lady Jin have sat back
and let me get away with it

24:20.041 --> 24:22.377
if I'd publicly humiliated her daughter?

24:22.961 --> 24:24.171
I'm not scared of you.

24:24.921 --> 24:28.466
But I am a little bit scared
of your mother, the leader of Jinyowon.

24:31.761 --> 24:33.263
Are you that frightened of your mother?

24:33.847 --> 24:36.766
It is true that I fear her,
but I hate you.

24:37.893 --> 24:38.935
I'm going to sell you.

24:39.811 --> 24:42.230
Like you said,
my mother is a frightening woman.

24:42.314 --> 24:45.692
And as punishment for what you did,
she's going to send you away.

24:45.775 --> 24:47.110
Somewhere far away!

24:55.285 --> 24:56.203
[sighs]

24:57.412 --> 24:58.246
[door closes]

24:58.914 --> 25:00.916
[suspenseful music]

25:07.672 --> 25:09.674
[thrilling music]

25:26.691 --> 25:27.525
[gasps]

25:28.401 --> 25:30.278
Did she run away?

26:01.977 --> 26:04.145
[Mu-deok] Should I try
climbing over this wall?

26:09.651 --> 26:11.403
[leaves rustling]

26:42.726 --> 26:44.769
[Cho-yeon] How did she open
the door to Jinyowon?

26:52.319 --> 26:54.988
So this is the Jin family's Jinyowon.

26:58.575 --> 27:02.120
If she gets locked in, she could die.

27:19.804 --> 27:21.806
[suspenseful music]

27:28.938 --> 27:30.065
[mirror Mu-deok] Hey.

27:37.364 --> 27:38.740
So it really is you.

27:43.036 --> 27:44.371
It's been a while.

28:00.470 --> 28:02.389
[ominous music]

28:12.023 --> 28:13.191
You can't leave.

28:13.900 --> 28:15.068
[laughter]

28:15.151 --> 28:16.444
It won't break.

28:18.363 --> 28:19.781
Nothing will work!

28:21.408 --> 28:22.575
[laughter]

28:23.827 --> 28:24.911
Just shut up!

28:35.422 --> 28:37.966
[Cho-yeon] A girl who can't even
cast spells went in there.

28:38.049 --> 28:39.634
Could she have died?

28:40.135 --> 28:41.970
They said they saw her illusion.

28:46.057 --> 28:47.183
[Dang-gu] Young Lady Jin.

28:48.393 --> 28:49.352
I think I…

28:50.311 --> 28:52.313
Every time you move, I hear something.

28:54.190 --> 28:55.024
It sounds like…

28:55.817 --> 28:58.069
jade clinking together.

29:01.030 --> 29:02.198
[soft clink]

29:07.370 --> 29:08.371
[sighs]

29:12.459 --> 29:13.710
[Jang Uk] Mu-deok!

29:21.551 --> 29:23.636
[Seo Yul] The hour is up. We must leave.

29:23.720 --> 29:26.014
I must find her. I'm staying here.

29:26.097 --> 29:29.476
This place is too large
for just the three of us to search.

29:29.559 --> 29:32.812
You only came to see inside Jinyowon,
so you can leave, Your Highness.

29:34.689 --> 29:36.483
How did you get
Mu-deok's illusion to come out?

29:37.525 --> 29:38.985
I don't know where it came from.

29:39.778 --> 29:40.612
But…

29:43.740 --> 29:45.992
I came because you kept thinking of me.

29:46.534 --> 29:47.619
[Go Won] That's right.

29:47.702 --> 29:48.787
She said that to me too.

29:49.412 --> 29:50.997
She came to me because I thought of her.

29:51.080 --> 29:54.834
So, if you think of Mu-deok,
her illusion appears before you.

29:55.585 --> 29:56.836
So, you did not see it.

29:57.504 --> 29:59.088
She visited me and Yul,

29:59.172 --> 30:01.758
but not you,
even though you are her master.

30:01.841 --> 30:04.636
Why in the world were you thinking
about Mu-deok, Your Highness?

30:08.515 --> 30:10.683
I was drinking wine,
and it reminded me of her.

30:10.767 --> 30:13.770
So, you were the one who got Mu-deok
drunk and reeking of cinnamon?

30:13.853 --> 30:14.813
Yes, indeed.

30:15.814 --> 30:17.774
I also gave her a sachet that day.

30:17.857 --> 30:20.693
So the cinnamon that you smelled
probably came from my sachet.

30:21.694 --> 30:23.238
Ah, right.

30:23.738 --> 30:26.407
The sachet that she hung
by the toilet to get rid of the flies?

30:27.075 --> 30:28.493
The-- By the toilet?

30:28.576 --> 30:31.871
Thank you very much, Your Highness.
I was able to do my business comfortably.

30:33.790 --> 30:36.334
Yul, what were you doing
when you saw her illusion?

30:39.212 --> 30:40.046
The mirror.

30:41.631 --> 30:44.092
- My mirror broke.
- So did the one in my room.

30:47.095 --> 30:48.471
Maybe it came through the mirror.

30:51.182 --> 30:52.016
The mirror?

30:53.601 --> 30:55.061
[Jang Uk breathes heavily]

30:57.647 --> 30:58.481
Is this it?

31:10.034 --> 31:12.161
[Seo Yul] That's not you, either.
It's fake.

31:12.245 --> 31:13.454
It's an illusion.

31:22.422 --> 31:23.464
So it is you.

31:30.013 --> 31:31.472
She is trapped inside the mirror?

31:32.682 --> 31:33.808
[Seo Yul] Correct.

31:33.892 --> 31:36.978
We are unable to see what's inside,
but we're certain she's in there.

31:37.645 --> 31:38.855
The Mirror of Longing.

31:40.023 --> 31:41.274
Longing?

31:41.357 --> 31:43.735
That mirror is a relic
that creates delusions.

31:44.360 --> 31:47.238
It uses other mirrors to show
the illusions of things

31:47.322 --> 31:48.364
that people long for.

31:49.490 --> 31:52.160
It seems she was sucked inside
while standing in front of it,

31:52.243 --> 31:54.245
since she has no abilities.

31:55.371 --> 31:57.707
We need to get Mu-deok out of the mirror.

31:57.790 --> 32:01.252
Since Jinyowon's energy is so strong,
we cannot do it with our spells.

32:02.670 --> 32:04.464
Please, remove the mirror from Jinyowon.

32:05.506 --> 32:06.674
I cannot move the mirror.

32:08.009 --> 32:09.969
That relic has swallowed a human.

32:10.053 --> 32:12.013
It is too dangerous to bring it outside.

32:13.598 --> 32:15.266
As Crown Prince, I order you.

32:15.350 --> 32:16.476
Go bring out the mirror.

32:16.559 --> 32:17.393
[scoffs]

32:19.020 --> 32:22.732
Jinyowon is protected by a plaque

32:22.815 --> 32:25.526
from The Unanimous Assembly
for situations like this.

32:27.862 --> 32:31.157
Even if the king commands it,
I don't have to take it out.

32:33.993 --> 32:35.328
Uk will not come out of there…

32:36.663 --> 32:37.956
while Mu-deok's trapped inside.

32:38.039 --> 32:40.500
That's out of my control.
He'll have to stay inside then.

32:41.334 --> 32:43.711
Once the hour I promised you is over,

32:43.795 --> 32:45.672
I will seal the door to Jinyowon.

32:48.800 --> 32:49.717
Mother.

32:50.593 --> 32:52.595
I found it. The jade.

32:55.932 --> 32:57.976
Mu-deok must not have stolen it after all.

32:59.018 --> 33:00.561
Now that I have found it,

33:00.645 --> 33:03.147
please bring out the mirror
and get her out of there.

33:03.231 --> 33:05.942
If Young Master Jang is locked
in there, he will die.

33:06.859 --> 33:07.819
You stay out of this.

33:09.779 --> 33:12.865
Once the agreed time is over,
I shall seal the door again.

33:19.330 --> 33:20.164
[grunting]

33:24.210 --> 33:25.712
[evil laughter]

33:28.506 --> 33:30.091
[mirror Jang Uk] It's no use!

33:30.174 --> 33:32.218
You can't break it, and you know it.

33:32.301 --> 33:34.262
Just shut up! You're an illusion.

33:34.345 --> 33:36.931
Yes. And I am…

33:38.016 --> 33:39.934
a delusion that reflects yourself.

33:42.854 --> 33:43.688
[exhales deeply]

33:44.522 --> 33:47.275
Humans can't see themselves
with their own eyes.

33:47.358 --> 33:49.652
They need a mirror to behold themselves.

33:50.945 --> 33:53.489
So the perceptions that
you have about yourself…

33:54.574 --> 33:56.159
are just a delusion.

33:59.954 --> 34:03.041
The same can be said
for how others perceive you.

34:03.875 --> 34:07.879
Just another delusion.
They see only what they want to see.

34:10.548 --> 34:11.883
Nothing is real.

34:12.550 --> 34:13.885
If this is true,

34:15.094 --> 34:17.597
that means everyone only sees
nothing but illusions.

34:18.848 --> 34:19.724
That's right.

34:20.683 --> 34:24.312
So I conjure the form they long for
the most and show them that.

34:28.066 --> 34:29.734
I'll do the same for you.

34:37.158 --> 34:39.452
Give me your energy. And then…

34:41.037 --> 34:43.039
I promise I'll make you perfect.

34:49.212 --> 34:50.088
But…

34:51.714 --> 34:54.592
you need my reflection
to create this illusion, don't you?

34:55.968 --> 34:56.803
Huh?

34:57.678 --> 34:59.263
If it isn't reflecting anything…

35:01.516 --> 35:02.934
a mirror becomes useless.

35:05.436 --> 35:07.688
[mirror Jang Uk breathes heavily, shouts]

35:23.454 --> 35:25.706
All that for a piece of glass just used…

35:27.583 --> 35:28.626
for combing hair.

35:30.586 --> 35:31.504
Mu-deok!

35:32.755 --> 35:34.340
Mu-deok! Are you in there?

35:36.008 --> 35:36.884
[Jang Uk] Mu-deok!

35:38.636 --> 35:39.470
Jang Uk.

35:42.640 --> 35:43.683
Uk!

35:45.560 --> 35:47.145
[Mu-deok] Uk, I am in here!

35:49.522 --> 35:50.565
I found you.

35:53.234 --> 35:54.068
[relieved sigh]

35:55.903 --> 35:57.113
[breathes heavily]

35:58.197 --> 35:59.115
[Ho-gyeong] Time is up.

36:00.491 --> 36:02.660
Cho-yeon, go seal the door off right now.

36:02.743 --> 36:03.828
Mother.

36:04.829 --> 36:06.080
Do it now!

36:06.164 --> 36:07.999
- [door opens]
- [Jin] Please wait a moment.

36:09.000 --> 36:10.626
[tense music]

36:19.302 --> 36:20.887
Allow me to go inside myself.

36:22.346 --> 36:24.307
If the relic cannot be removed
from Jinyowon,

36:24.390 --> 36:27.226
then I will go in there
and retrieve the girl

36:27.310 --> 36:28.769
trapped in the Mirror of Longing.

36:28.853 --> 36:31.939
You're a high-level mage.
How can I trust you to go in there?

36:32.023 --> 36:33.316
Please, believe me.

36:34.108 --> 36:36.694
I will not touch any other artifacts.

36:36.777 --> 36:38.154
Why should I?

36:38.237 --> 36:41.532
My trust was broken once before,
also by a Songrim mage.

36:43.659 --> 36:47.079
Have you ever allowed a Songrim mage
to enter into Jinyowon before?

36:49.999 --> 36:51.626
If you want to save Jang Uk,

36:51.709 --> 36:55.546
you must ask the mages of Jeongjingak
so they can drag him out of there.

36:59.717 --> 37:00.760
My lord.

37:00.843 --> 37:02.011
We are running out of time.

37:05.556 --> 37:07.934
Yul, I want you to go in there

37:08.684 --> 37:10.269
and bring Uk out with you.

37:15.816 --> 37:16.692
Mu-deok.

37:18.027 --> 37:19.153
While you were gone,

37:20.613 --> 37:22.156
I sat down and started thinking.

37:23.950 --> 37:25.159
Thinking about…

37:26.577 --> 37:28.663
what I need to do to keep you by my side.

37:31.958 --> 37:33.834
If I become Cheonbugwan's Gwanju,

37:35.753 --> 37:37.421
you'll be Assistant Gwanju.

37:38.339 --> 37:40.007
Why would I want that?

37:40.091 --> 37:42.760
[Jang Uk] You said you didn't want
to stay by my side as a servant.

37:42.843 --> 37:45.680
We can't tell anyone that
you are my master, and I'm your pupil.

37:45.763 --> 37:48.307
But if you are
my Assistant Gwanju, you'll stay.

37:48.391 --> 37:51.519
You will be Cheonbugwan's Gwanju
with a soul shifter by your side?

37:53.437 --> 37:54.272
You are mad.

37:57.900 --> 38:00.027
I thought about it
when I heard about my marriage.

38:01.279 --> 38:03.155
"So, he finally has a way out."

38:04.323 --> 38:05.741
"What if he abandons me?"

38:07.827 --> 38:09.745
You must have felt lost thinking that.

38:15.710 --> 38:17.169
But now that you are gone,

38:19.672 --> 38:20.715
I feel lost.

38:25.553 --> 38:27.555
[soft music]

38:36.230 --> 38:37.189
Mu-deok.

38:39.150 --> 38:40.192
I miss you.

38:41.861 --> 38:43.821
[soft music continues playing]

39:14.352 --> 39:16.437
[Mu-deok] Pretend you know nothing,
even if they catch me.

39:16.520 --> 39:19.857
Not a single soul in Songrim would ever
allow that thing to attack me.

39:26.197 --> 39:27.907
[Mu-deok] Then I'll ask this
of you, Jang Uk.

39:27.990 --> 39:29.367
Please take me up there.

39:30.534 --> 39:31.369
[Jang Uk] Sure.

39:31.452 --> 39:34.914
I'll take you to the top
of wherever you want to go.

39:34.997 --> 39:36.874
[soft music continues playing]

40:04.276 --> 40:06.070
[loud roar]

40:06.153 --> 40:07.655
[mirror rumbling]

40:07.738 --> 40:08.656
Mu-deok.

40:09.198 --> 40:10.116
What's happening?

40:12.493 --> 40:13.661
[child] She is here!

40:13.744 --> 40:14.620
[man] Who?

40:15.538 --> 40:17.164
[child] It is her. The blind girl!

40:18.249 --> 40:19.333
[man] It's the ice stone!

40:24.004 --> 40:25.423
The mirror is going to shatter.

40:26.173 --> 40:27.133
Step back.

40:27.216 --> 40:28.050
[gasps]

40:28.134 --> 40:29.552
[mirror rumbling]

40:56.203 --> 40:58.164
[epic music playing]

41:24.273 --> 41:25.316
[door closes]

41:30.863 --> 41:31.822
[maid Kim] Young Master.

41:32.406 --> 41:33.240
Mu-deok.

41:33.741 --> 41:36.076
- Are you all right?
- Uh-huh, I'm all right.

41:36.160 --> 41:38.078
- Is Mu-deok all right?
- Yes, Of course.

42:07.316 --> 42:09.902
I fell while bringing out
the yin-yang jade.

42:11.070 --> 42:13.364
I think that was when it broke.

42:14.657 --> 42:17.493
So you tried to blame
a servant for the broken jade.

42:19.328 --> 42:20.579
What about the Mirror of Longing?

42:21.789 --> 42:23.707
I remember it was next to me when I fell,

42:24.375 --> 42:25.501
but I didn't touch it.

42:26.126 --> 42:29.171
How could Uk possibly break
the mirror with his abilities?

42:30.256 --> 42:31.549
[Cho-yeon] Then I suppose

42:31.632 --> 42:34.802
I must have somehow also
harmed the mirror when I fell.

42:38.931 --> 42:40.140
Was it you

42:40.891 --> 42:43.978
who locked Mu-deok
in Jinyowon, Young Lady Jin?

42:44.061 --> 42:47.690
I did seal the door,
but she'd already opened it herself.

42:47.773 --> 42:51.527
That door can't be opened
by anyone outside the Jin family.

42:53.195 --> 42:54.697
But you're saying Mu-deok opened it?

42:56.782 --> 42:58.200
Then I suppose…

42:59.159 --> 43:00.786
I must have opened the door.

43:01.579 --> 43:04.456
I saw her go inside
and I locked her in there.

43:04.540 --> 43:05.624
[chuckles]

43:07.126 --> 43:08.168
[Cho-yeon] Please, forgive me!

43:09.712 --> 43:10.879
I'll tell everyone…

43:12.673 --> 43:15.593
that they should keep quiet
about this whole incident.

43:18.137 --> 43:21.140
Considering your reputation,
I'll keep quiet as well.

43:22.391 --> 43:24.143
I deeply apologize.

43:28.063 --> 43:29.106
Are you all right?

43:30.065 --> 43:31.400
You're still unable to see?

43:33.235 --> 43:34.069
Yes.

43:34.695 --> 43:36.989
When the mirror broke,
I saw a really bright light.

43:37.615 --> 43:39.158
And now I can't open my eyes.

43:42.453 --> 43:44.371
We should protect
your eyes from the light.

43:47.833 --> 43:48.709
Here.

43:49.293 --> 43:50.127
[Mu-deok] Oh.

43:53.547 --> 43:55.633
Usually, if you stare at the sun too long,

43:55.716 --> 43:57.176
you can't see for a little bit.

43:58.093 --> 43:59.303
I'm sure you'll recover soon.

44:01.055 --> 44:02.556
I am sorry for this.

44:03.140 --> 44:04.558
What have you done wrong?

44:05.392 --> 44:06.977
Young Lady Jin is at fault.

44:17.696 --> 44:19.490
[Dang-gu] Are you all right, Mu-deok?

44:20.074 --> 44:21.867
What are you doing here,
Young Master Park?

44:21.950 --> 44:22.785
[Dang-gu] Oh, my goodness!

44:24.578 --> 44:25.996
I came because I was worried.

44:26.622 --> 44:27.748
I see you've hurt your eyes.

44:28.582 --> 44:30.209
You're here, too, Young Master Seo?

44:34.713 --> 44:37.841
You should be treated at Sejukwon.
I'll take you there.

44:37.925 --> 44:39.843
[Go Won] The palace is nearby.
She will go there.

44:40.344 --> 44:42.596
Huh, Your Highness is here, too?

44:42.680 --> 44:44.723
[soft music playing]

44:48.102 --> 44:49.853
I will take you to the royal clinic.

44:50.479 --> 44:51.855
[maid Kim] That's not necessary.

44:51.939 --> 44:55.192
She's temporarily blinded by the light.
But she's not injured.

44:56.235 --> 44:59.363
I know you didn't plan any of this,
but they came here for you.

44:59.446 --> 45:02.157
You should apologize,
thank them, and bid them farewell.

45:04.660 --> 45:06.662
I apologize for this.

45:07.329 --> 45:08.831
Thank you very much.

45:21.301 --> 45:22.261
Young Master.

45:24.012 --> 45:25.055
Let's go home now.

45:49.246 --> 45:51.081
After what happened today,

45:52.416 --> 45:55.210
I'm doubtful the wedding will
proceed as planned.

45:55.294 --> 45:56.587
Did you hear what she said?

45:57.504 --> 46:01.049
She was going to close the door
even if the Young Master would die.

46:01.133 --> 46:02.259
How terrifying!

46:02.342 --> 46:05.345
Sending him to live
with a mother-in-law like that worries me.

46:05.429 --> 46:07.514
She made that choice to protect Jinyowon.

46:08.265 --> 46:10.976
When you have a lot to protect, sometimes…

46:11.977 --> 46:13.479
you have no choice but to be heartless.

46:14.146 --> 46:14.980
So, then…

46:16.231 --> 46:17.941
are you saying
you would have done the same?

46:19.359 --> 46:22.237
I'd say that you and I are rather close.

46:22.321 --> 46:23.947
What if I were locked inside?

46:24.031 --> 46:25.741
Would you seal the door?

46:26.617 --> 46:27.534
Heartlessly?

46:28.535 --> 46:29.953
[quirky music]

46:32.164 --> 46:33.123
Oh, my!

46:34.166 --> 46:35.375
So, you would seal it?

46:36.752 --> 46:38.879
Even if it meant I might die in there?

46:38.962 --> 46:41.048
Don't overthink it, though.

46:42.633 --> 46:44.259
Nothing has even happened yet.

46:44.343 --> 46:46.803
I am not even actually locked inside.

46:46.887 --> 46:49.306
Would it be too much
to ask you to lie and say

46:49.389 --> 46:51.600
- "I'll never seal the door"?
- I…

46:52.100 --> 46:55.103
cannot give you empty words.

46:57.606 --> 46:58.607
Indeed.

46:59.816 --> 47:01.860
That is the kind of man you are after all.

47:06.281 --> 47:08.450
Well, just speak with
the Young Master before you leave.

47:09.117 --> 47:10.327
No.

47:10.410 --> 47:12.955
I mean, what could I
possibly have to say to Jang Uk.

47:14.206 --> 47:16.291
I can't give him empty words.

47:17.084 --> 47:17.918
Yes.

47:18.919 --> 47:20.170
Thank you for your help today.

47:20.754 --> 47:21.588
Goodbye.

47:31.306 --> 47:32.349
But know this…

47:34.726 --> 47:36.311
if I did have to seal it,

47:37.813 --> 47:39.439
my heart would be shattered…

47:42.192 --> 47:43.235
to pieces.

47:43.318 --> 47:45.320
[somber music]

47:51.159 --> 47:53.954
He's so slow-witted and stubborn.

47:56.164 --> 47:58.750
"How could I seal the door
with you inside?"

48:00.252 --> 48:02.337
Is that so hard for you to say?

48:17.728 --> 48:18.937
That was dangerous.

48:21.023 --> 48:22.441
Entering Jinyowon

48:22.524 --> 48:25.110
was reckless, childish and stubborn.

48:25.193 --> 48:26.987
You don't need to be so angry.

48:28.322 --> 48:30.407
Your perception of me as pathetic…

48:31.450 --> 48:32.534
is an illusion.

48:34.578 --> 48:35.412
What?

48:35.495 --> 48:37.581
The mirror inside Jinyowon said it.

48:38.290 --> 48:40.125
It said that what people see

48:40.208 --> 48:42.377
are delusions of what they wish to see.

48:43.462 --> 48:44.421
It's an illusion.

48:44.504 --> 48:46.757
Are you saying that
I see you as an illusion?

48:46.840 --> 48:47.674
If not…

48:49.134 --> 48:51.178
why do you tell me to not do anything?

48:54.556 --> 48:56.266
Throughout my life, I tried

48:57.392 --> 49:00.312
so hard to prove
that I was my father's son. But…

49:01.980 --> 49:04.066
even though it hurt
when you told me I wasn't,

49:04.149 --> 49:05.275
it shattered my delusion.

49:05.984 --> 49:07.486
But after all of that,

49:07.569 --> 49:09.738
how can you tell me
to go on living that illusion?

49:09.821 --> 49:11.323
I don't care about this.

49:12.658 --> 49:14.201
Illusion nonsense.

49:15.410 --> 49:16.370
My only wish…

49:18.288 --> 49:20.207
is for you to be safe and sound.

49:24.169 --> 49:27.631
The delusion I tried so hard
to prove my whole life is shattered.

49:29.925 --> 49:31.343
So from this point on,

49:32.844 --> 49:34.221
I'll fight harder…

49:35.806 --> 49:36.848
to find out…

49:38.725 --> 49:40.227
the truth about who I am.

49:54.574 --> 49:55.409
[sighs]

50:11.591 --> 50:12.426
Can you see?

50:13.760 --> 50:15.762
Yes, I can.

50:16.596 --> 50:17.431
[exhales in relief]

50:20.684 --> 50:21.518
What?

50:21.601 --> 50:23.895
I was told that
the mirror was making illusions of you.

50:23.979 --> 50:26.940
So I'm checking that the one
I pulled out is the real Mu-deok.

50:28.191 --> 50:30.610
You didn't pull me out.
I broke the mirror myself.

50:31.486 --> 50:32.320
Hmm?

50:32.404 --> 50:34.740
While I was inside that strange place,

50:34.823 --> 50:36.825
I temporarily regained my energy

50:36.908 --> 50:38.910
just like at Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

50:39.911 --> 50:42.205
I'm sure I broke the mirror
with my own power.

50:42.289 --> 50:43.874
You think so?

50:43.957 --> 50:46.042
I was so excited thinking that I broke it.

50:46.126 --> 50:47.210
Not at all.

50:47.294 --> 50:49.921
At your level, you should be grateful
it didn't suck you in.

50:50.005 --> 50:53.008
I did think about going into
the mirror because you were inside.

50:53.091 --> 50:55.051
That's such a foolish idea.

50:55.135 --> 50:57.053
Unless it swallowed you and spit me out.

50:57.137 --> 50:59.473
So if it had swallowed me,
that would be a good idea?

50:59.556 --> 51:00.932
Well, then I would have survived.

51:01.016 --> 51:02.350
And then, I would have died.

51:04.102 --> 51:07.105
My pupil, when there's no
other alternative,

51:07.189 --> 51:08.982
it's only right
that you sacrifice yourself

51:09.065 --> 51:10.400
to save your master.

51:10.484 --> 51:11.818
No, I don't want to.

51:13.278 --> 51:14.654
If I die, you should die beside me.

51:14.738 --> 51:16.990
Don't think that you're going
to survive here by yourself.

51:17.491 --> 51:19.743
- [scoffs]
- You have no other choice.

51:19.826 --> 51:21.119
When you put your pupil in danger,

51:21.203 --> 51:23.038
the master should be prepared
to die as well.

51:23.955 --> 51:26.833
- All right. I'll keep that in mind.
- Hmm.

51:26.917 --> 51:28.835
But what about your engagement

51:28.919 --> 51:31.630
to the woman
who almost killed your master?

51:31.713 --> 51:32.589
[sighs]

51:32.672 --> 51:35.634
Marrying Jin Cho-yeon will certainly
guarantee my safety.

51:38.970 --> 51:40.722
But if his master nearly died

51:41.389 --> 51:43.183
then the pupil should risk his life, too.

51:49.648 --> 51:51.983
[Ho-gyeong] This is a marriage
of convenience,

51:52.067 --> 51:55.237
so let us resolve
any emotional issues after the wedding.

51:55.320 --> 51:58.073
The reason that
the Jin family needs me for a son-in-law

51:58.782 --> 52:00.283
is because I'm Jang Gang's son

52:00.367 --> 52:02.369
and next in line to become
Gwanju of Cheonbugwan.

52:03.245 --> 52:05.372
Think of it as our families
combining strength.

52:06.331 --> 52:09.209
Yes. Since this is
a marriage of convenience,

52:10.168 --> 52:12.629
we should be honest
about what we can offer each other.

52:13.421 --> 52:15.924
Apparently, I am not the son
of the Gwanju, Jang Gang.

52:18.802 --> 52:20.804
I do not care about such rumors.

52:23.265 --> 52:25.100
But what if that rumor turns out…

52:26.393 --> 52:27.352
to be true?

52:30.272 --> 52:32.190
Think about whether or not you're willing

52:32.941 --> 52:35.819
to take that risk to have me
as the Jin family's son-in-law.

52:48.039 --> 52:50.542
I see you still have
the binding bracelet on.

52:50.625 --> 52:51.877
[sighs]
Ah.

52:53.378 --> 52:54.588
Yes.

52:57.632 --> 52:59.634
And you're as impudent as ever, too.

53:08.894 --> 53:12.731
Why did you decide to marry off Cho-yeon
without even discussing it with me?

53:13.857 --> 53:17.235
Who do you think you are
to meddle in our family matters?

53:17.319 --> 53:18.236
Sister.

53:20.655 --> 53:22.073
It's also my family.

53:23.825 --> 53:28.455
The name "Jin" is only given
to those children born of Jin mothers.

53:29.706 --> 53:33.418
My mother was a fool to have given
our family name to someone like you,

53:34.085 --> 53:36.254
conceived elsewhere by our father.

53:36.963 --> 53:40.175
As soon as you became
leader of Jinyowon, you chased me out.

53:41.134 --> 53:43.428
To this day,
you still resent me that much?

53:43.511 --> 53:44.721
I don't resent you.

53:45.847 --> 53:47.390
I detest you.

53:50.352 --> 53:53.063
I detest that slyness of yours.

53:54.898 --> 53:55.815
[chuckles softly]

53:56.942 --> 54:00.737
The leader of Jinyowon should not
make decisions based on preference.

54:01.404 --> 54:03.907
Choosing Jang Uk was the wrong decision.

54:03.990 --> 54:05.408
Call off the marriage.

54:05.492 --> 54:06.701
What?

54:07.410 --> 54:11.247
I'll give you
a much better card than Jang Uk.

54:11.998 --> 54:13.333
How would you like

54:14.209 --> 54:15.835
the Crown Prince as your son-in-law?

54:17.379 --> 54:18.254
[scoffs]

54:19.798 --> 54:23.176
You expect the Crown Prince
to come live with our family?

54:23.843 --> 54:25.512
Cho-yeon is the second daughter.

54:25.595 --> 54:28.139
It's Bu-yeon, your eldest,
who will lead the family.

54:29.099 --> 54:31.226
Why must Cho-yeon's husband move in

54:31.309 --> 54:32.894
when there's also Bu-yeon?

54:34.437 --> 54:38.608
What are you planning…
that you dare to speak of Bu-yeon?

54:39.192 --> 54:40.986
[breathes deeply]

54:43.363 --> 54:46.908
[Jin Mu] I understand that your husband is
still searching for Bu-yeon.

54:47.534 --> 54:50.203
And as the Assistant Gwanju
of Cheonbugwan,

54:50.286 --> 54:52.580
I'll do everything
in my power to find the daughter…

54:53.748 --> 54:55.166
that you've been longing for.

54:57.002 --> 54:59.587
I'll find Bu-yeon
and make her leader of Jinyowon,

54:59.671 --> 55:03.925
and I'll make Cho-yeon queen.
So please, do not marry her to Jang Uk.

55:06.469 --> 55:07.554
Your brother…

55:08.471 --> 55:11.766
will become Cheonbugwan's Gwanju
and an ally to Jinyowon,

55:13.393 --> 55:15.478
because I am a part
of this family, after all.

55:16.187 --> 55:18.189
[suspenseful music]

55:30.702 --> 55:33.663
Hey, Yul. I've been
wondering about something.

55:34.372 --> 55:36.249
What was it that made you
think about Mu-deok?

55:37.709 --> 55:39.419
I was not thinking about Mu-deok.

55:40.587 --> 55:43.423
I also find it odd
that the illusion appeared as her

55:44.174 --> 55:46.009
- and said that.
- What did it say to you?

55:46.968 --> 55:48.136
Hey, hey, Yul.

55:48.219 --> 55:49.554
It's this way!

55:50.221 --> 55:52.974
Why do you keep going the wrong way?
What exactly is going on with you?

55:57.645 --> 55:58.772
I will be fine.

56:01.858 --> 56:02.817
Goodness!

56:05.028 --> 56:05.862
Huh?

56:06.529 --> 56:07.906
It's package delivery.

56:09.115 --> 56:12.911
[Dang-gu] Young Lady Jin's marriage gifts
should be delivered to Songrim today.

56:13.703 --> 56:15.580
[sighs]
No one should see them.

56:16.664 --> 56:18.124
I'd better go and receive them.

56:29.636 --> 56:31.012
[bird chirping]

56:31.096 --> 56:33.556
[man 1] Ah! The bird!
The bird! Catch the bird!

56:33.640 --> 56:34.933
- Quick! Catch it!
- [man 2] Oh, oh, no!

56:35.600 --> 56:36.976
- [man 1 groans]
- [man 2] Where is it going?

56:38.269 --> 56:40.188
[man 1] There, there, there, there!
Come on!

56:40.271 --> 56:41.189
[man 2] Come on! Oh!

56:41.272 --> 56:42.774
- Seriously!
- [man 1 yells]

56:43.775 --> 56:45.401
[man 1] No, no, no, no!

56:46.027 --> 56:48.029
[bird whistle blowing]

57:20.103 --> 57:22.188
[Jin] Naksu uses the alchemy of souls.

57:25.275 --> 57:28.945
[Dang-gu] What if Naksu shifted her soul
into another woman's body?

57:35.994 --> 57:38.496
[mirror Mu-deok] You were longing for
the one you met at Danhyanggok.

57:39.873 --> 57:41.583
If you keep thinking of me,

57:43.460 --> 57:44.794
I will visit you.

57:46.379 --> 57:50.175
Winter in Danhyanggok is
much warmer than you would think.

57:51.176 --> 57:54.429
As soon as the sun rises,
the snow tends to melt pretty quickly.

58:01.603 --> 58:02.562
Mu-deok…

58:04.189 --> 58:05.356
is Naksu.

58:06.024 --> 58:08.026
[dramatic music]

58:43.019 --> 58:45.021
[indistinct chatter]

58:47.357 --> 58:49.359
[suspenseful music]

59:07.877 --> 59:10.964
You left this at Danhyanggok, Naksu.

59:16.302 --> 59:18.680
After all this time, I've found you.

59:33.444 --> 59:34.279
[sighs]

59:41.077 --> 59:41.911
Mu-deok.

59:42.745 --> 59:44.372
Do you know how long
I've been waiting for you?

59:45.039 --> 59:46.541
Maidservant Kim didn't tell you?

59:46.624 --> 59:48.251
You were supposed to be here by noon.

59:50.128 --> 59:52.964
Let's go. We'll get
to Danhyanggok by sunset.

59:53.047 --> 59:54.215
Instead of Danhyanggok…

59:56.426 --> 59:57.844
let us go somewhere else.

59:59.012 --> 01:00:00.096
Like where?

01:00:01.139 --> 01:00:03.600
There is an empty temple
by the eastern forest.

01:00:04.225 --> 01:00:05.310
Let us go there.

01:00:05.393 --> 01:00:07.395
[somber music]

01:00:10.189 --> 01:00:11.065
[sighs]

01:00:11.649 --> 01:00:13.985
[Gil-ju] If you bring
Jang Uk here tonight,

01:00:14.068 --> 01:00:15.612
then I shall spare your life.

01:00:21.451 --> 01:00:23.453
[Mu-deok] I must sacrifice you to survive.

01:00:24.245 --> 01:00:25.496
It is only right.

01:00:28.082 --> 01:00:29.292
[Jang Uk] The marriage is off.

01:00:30.543 --> 01:00:32.503
I gave them an excuse to get rid of me.

01:00:33.504 --> 01:00:34.339
[Mu-deok] I see.

01:00:35.381 --> 01:00:36.424
[Jang Uk] But…

01:00:39.594 --> 01:00:42.305
Maidservant Kim already received
the yin-yang jade.

01:00:42.972 --> 01:00:44.682
So I made something out of it.

01:00:52.106 --> 01:00:53.858
- Bird's eggs.
- Yes.

01:00:54.525 --> 01:00:55.985
Pick one. We'll each keep one, okay?

01:00:59.947 --> 01:01:02.241
Oh, you know how strange
our relationship is.

01:01:02.325 --> 01:01:05.036
Young master and servant.
Pupil and master.

01:01:05.119 --> 01:01:08.164
So I made them as a token for us
so we can remember to stay, um…

01:01:08.956 --> 01:01:10.500
dutiful and loyal.

01:01:14.212 --> 01:01:15.463
Or I can just choose.

01:01:15.546 --> 01:01:17.382
I pick red. You can have blue.

01:01:21.761 --> 01:01:25.807
Master, let us stay forever
loyal and dutiful to each other.

01:01:32.814 --> 01:01:34.774
- Jang Uk.
- Hmm?

01:01:37.360 --> 01:01:38.945
Let us part ways here.

01:01:43.491 --> 01:01:45.326
I will return to where I came from.

01:01:47.578 --> 01:01:50.248
- But they abandoned you, didn't they?
- I met them today.

01:01:51.124 --> 01:01:52.500
They know who I am now.

01:01:53.459 --> 01:01:55.211
And they asked me to come back with them.

01:01:55.294 --> 01:01:58.131
- You said they were dangerous, though.
- As you can see, I am alive and well.

01:01:58.756 --> 01:02:01.134
If they wanted to kill me,
they would have done it already.

01:02:01.801 --> 01:02:05.805
If I go back to them,
I will be able to retrieve my energy.

01:02:13.938 --> 01:02:14.939
I promised to do that.

01:02:15.022 --> 01:02:17.567
I told you that
I'd push you to the edge of a cliff.

01:02:18.860 --> 01:02:22.113
It's true. I pushed you too far.

01:02:24.198 --> 01:02:25.992
And you did try your best.

01:02:26.743 --> 01:02:28.619
- And we can keep doing that together.
- No.

01:02:29.203 --> 01:02:32.248
If we stay together, you will die,

01:02:32.999 --> 01:02:34.417
and I will get caught.

01:02:45.303 --> 01:02:47.388
[suspenseful music]

01:02:55.897 --> 01:03:00.067
What business does the leader of Songrim
have to ask to meet me in secret?

01:03:00.151 --> 01:03:01.611
I need to ask you

01:03:02.278 --> 01:03:06.324
about a Cheonbugwan mage
from 20 years ago named Cho Chung.

01:03:11.746 --> 01:03:13.539
[Heo Yeom] Naksu's father, Cho Chung,

01:03:14.457 --> 01:03:15.625
was a soul shifter.

01:03:17.627 --> 01:03:19.295
By the time we found him,

01:03:20.087 --> 01:03:21.964
he had already run wild.

01:03:22.465 --> 01:03:26.385
He had massacred
nearly everyone in his family.

01:03:27.553 --> 01:03:29.555
[somber music]

01:03:33.309 --> 01:03:35.436
The four families had to get involved

01:03:36.145 --> 01:03:37.772
to put an end to the killing.

01:03:37.855 --> 01:03:39.232
[shouts]

01:03:45.112 --> 01:03:47.865
So, Naksu's father was a soul shifter?

01:03:48.533 --> 01:03:50.159
To a child,

01:03:50.243 --> 01:03:53.788
we must have looked like
murderers who killed her father.

01:03:55.998 --> 01:03:59.085
She must have thought
her father was murdered by us.

01:03:59.877 --> 01:04:02.463
That's probably why
she became an assassin.

01:04:04.757 --> 01:04:07.677
What's this important matter
you wanted to talk about?

01:04:07.760 --> 01:04:10.555
Have you… recalled it?

01:04:14.725 --> 01:04:17.854
If I see you again,
I won't hesitate to kill you.

01:04:22.984 --> 01:04:24.861
Are you implying that I, Jin Mu,

01:04:24.944 --> 01:04:28.239
took in Cho Chung's daughter
and trained her to become an assassin?

01:04:28.322 --> 01:04:31.617
I assume that the reason you burned
Naksu's body as soon as you found it

01:04:31.701 --> 01:04:34.120
was because you were afraid that
her identity might be revealed,

01:04:34.203 --> 01:04:35.329
was it not?

01:04:36.956 --> 01:04:40.418
Instead of saying what you wish to hear,
I'll tell you what actually happened.

01:04:44.046 --> 01:04:45.965
At Cheonbugwan, we record the stars

01:04:46.048 --> 01:04:48.593
with the most energy
every night from 1 to 3 a.m.

01:04:49.302 --> 01:04:53.014
Then, after the Gwanju checks it
later that day, the record is stored here.

01:04:54.307 --> 01:04:59.270
But one day, a constellation plate
recorded that night disappeared.

01:05:01.272 --> 01:05:04.525
Fortunately, it was soon found,
and the incident was resolved.

01:05:07.153 --> 01:05:09.864
So, why are you telling me this, Jin Mu?

01:05:13.701 --> 01:05:17.580
It was the day Jang Gang's wife, Do-hwa,
died while giving birth to Jang Uk.

01:05:18.748 --> 01:05:20.791
Cho Chung recorded the stars that day,

01:05:20.875 --> 01:05:24.295
and the one who discovered
the missing plate was me.

01:05:37.433 --> 01:05:38.643
KING GO SUN, YEAR ONE
FIRST DAY OF APRIL

01:05:38.726 --> 01:05:41.145
[Gang] I've already stolen the plate
that recorded the stars that night.

01:05:41.228 --> 01:05:44.607
The one in Cheonbugwan
is a fake without the King's Star.

01:05:50.196 --> 01:05:51.781
Are you telling me

01:05:51.864 --> 01:05:53.908
that you know what really happened

01:05:55.034 --> 01:05:56.994
the day that Jang Gang's son…

01:05:58.829 --> 01:06:00.247
Jang Uk, was born?

01:06:01.582 --> 01:06:02.458
[chuckles softly]

01:06:03.834 --> 01:06:07.088
A star that would bring disorder
to the world appeared that night.

01:06:12.343 --> 01:06:15.012
So, you knew about the King's Star?

01:06:15.096 --> 01:06:17.974
Do you think the secret was erased
with Cho Chung's death?

01:06:19.558 --> 01:06:20.851
Who do you think performed

01:06:20.935 --> 01:06:22.979
the alchemy of souls
that caused his death?

01:06:26.023 --> 01:06:29.193
Do not ask questions
you do not wish to hear the answers to

01:06:29.276 --> 01:06:32.029
if you want to protect
Songrim and your people.

01:06:44.750 --> 01:06:48.004
[Gil-ju] The Danju does not yet know
that you are still alive, Naksu.

01:06:49.880 --> 01:06:51.215
I did not tell him.

01:06:52.216 --> 01:06:53.592
Bring Jang Uk to me.

01:06:53.676 --> 01:06:55.720
And my lips will remain sealed.

01:07:00.266 --> 01:07:02.727
I will shift my soul into his body.

01:07:11.944 --> 01:07:13.195
[door creaks]

01:07:16.991 --> 01:07:18.868
[tense music]

01:07:22.246 --> 01:07:23.122
Where is Jang Uk?

01:07:24.373 --> 01:07:25.583
He will be here soon.

01:07:32.506 --> 01:07:34.759
[maid Kim] What brings you here
at such a late hour?

01:07:38.471 --> 01:07:39.972
Before Uk was ever born,

01:07:41.098 --> 01:07:43.350
close to about 20 years ago,

01:07:43.434 --> 01:07:44.727
did Jang Gang…

01:07:46.145 --> 01:07:48.064
master a type of sorcery?

01:07:48.939 --> 01:07:51.317
[thunder rumbles]

01:07:51.400 --> 01:07:52.777
Did Jang Gang…

01:07:54.320 --> 01:07:55.946
perform the alchemy of souls?

01:08:11.712 --> 01:08:13.047
What's taking him so long?

01:08:16.550 --> 01:08:18.010
It is finally raining now.

01:08:18.969 --> 01:08:20.304
He should be here.

01:08:24.558 --> 01:08:25.893
Did you try to fool me?

01:08:28.229 --> 01:08:30.272
Why are you stalling for time?

01:08:31.816 --> 01:08:34.902
Seeing as how the Danju
still has not shown up here yet,

01:08:34.985 --> 01:08:37.363
you really must be
the only one who knows about me.

01:08:39.281 --> 01:08:40.574
You little…
[yells angrily]

01:08:46.205 --> 01:08:48.207
[suspenseful music]

01:08:53.838 --> 01:08:54.672
[yells]

01:08:56.507 --> 01:08:58.134
[sword chiming]

01:09:04.974 --> 01:09:06.308
[Mu-deok] Let us end things here.

01:09:08.352 --> 01:09:10.563
What about the empty temple by the forest?

01:09:12.231 --> 01:09:14.859
Why were you taking me all the way
up here just to end things like this?

01:09:14.942 --> 01:09:17.027
I was going to hand you over to them.

01:09:18.863 --> 01:09:20.906
Now you know, so don't follow me.

01:09:21.615 --> 01:09:22.491
If that's what you want,

01:09:22.575 --> 01:09:24.243
then you shouldn't
have told me about the temple.

01:09:25.703 --> 01:09:27.788
If you leave after saying
such ominous things,

01:09:28.539 --> 01:09:30.541
how can I not follow you, Mu-deok?

01:09:33.794 --> 01:09:35.296
I'm more upset than you are.

01:09:35.379 --> 01:09:37.923
I gave up my chance to live
just for this bird's egg.

01:09:38.007 --> 01:09:40.134
I'm glad that I reminded you to be loyal.

01:09:40.217 --> 01:09:41.760
If I had not, I truly could have died.

01:09:43.554 --> 01:09:44.388
[sighs]

01:09:45.890 --> 01:09:47.474
Now that I helped you escape death,

01:09:49.101 --> 01:09:51.103
fight like your life depends on it,
my pupil.

01:09:52.188 --> 01:09:55.858
If you say it like that, it…
it sounds like you saved my life.

01:09:57.359 --> 01:09:59.820
If we're lucky
and that cloudy sky brings us rain,

01:10:01.697 --> 01:10:03.741
then we both might be able to live.

01:10:08.871 --> 01:10:09.955
[thunder rumbles]

01:10:12.541 --> 01:10:14.585
Jang Uk, you truly are lucky.

01:10:14.668 --> 01:10:16.587
It's really raining quite a bit.

01:10:17.630 --> 01:10:19.715
I can't be that lucky with that opponent.

01:10:20.966 --> 01:10:22.134
A mage of Cheonbugwan.

01:10:22.676 --> 01:10:24.261
Hi. Don't you remember me?

01:10:24.345 --> 01:10:25.387
[Gil-ju yells]

01:10:25.471 --> 01:10:26.305
[grunts]

01:10:31.977 --> 01:10:32.811
[groans]

01:10:44.490 --> 01:10:45.532
[grunts in pain]

01:10:47.409 --> 01:10:48.327
[Jang Uk grunts]

01:10:50.663 --> 01:10:52.373
[swords whooshing]

01:11:01.757 --> 01:11:02.633
[groans]

01:11:04.385 --> 01:11:05.302
[pants]

01:11:12.643 --> 01:11:13.686
[Jang Uk breathes heavily]

01:11:18.691 --> 01:11:19.900
[pants]

01:11:23.862 --> 01:11:25.364
[wind howls]

01:11:27.324 --> 01:11:29.326
[tense music]

01:12:04.903 --> 01:12:06.905
[tense music continues playing]

01:12:38.270 --> 01:12:40.356
[Mu-deok] It is time. Use Tansu.

01:12:40.439 --> 01:12:43.650
Instead of trying to meet the water-drops
with a sword you can't control,

01:12:43.734 --> 01:12:45.736
wield the sword
so that water-drops meet it.

01:12:45.819 --> 01:12:46.653
[grunts]

01:12:51.742 --> 01:12:52.618
[groans]

01:13:08.717 --> 01:13:09.593
[groans in pain]

01:13:22.606 --> 01:13:24.608
[ominous music]

01:13:44.586 --> 01:13:45.421
[Mu-deok] Oh, no.

01:13:49.508 --> 01:13:50.634
What is that?

01:13:50.717 --> 01:13:51.844
Alchemy of souls.

01:13:53.220 --> 01:13:54.930
[screams]

01:14:09.069 --> 01:14:10.863
[loud rumble]

01:14:11.780 --> 01:14:13.740
[suspenseful music]

01:14:43.520 --> 01:14:44.688
[Jang Uk] Is my soul

01:14:45.606 --> 01:14:46.815
being shifted right now?

01:14:53.155 --> 01:14:55.157
[closing theme music]

01:15:09.004 --> 01:15:10.422
Jang Uk! Jang Uk!

01:15:11.757 --> 01:15:15.469
Gil-ju, you bastard!
You managed to steal his body after all.

01:15:15.552 --> 01:15:18.096
I'm afraid Uk's fallen victim
to the alchemy of souls.

01:15:18.180 --> 01:15:19.097
What?

01:15:19.181 --> 01:15:21.099
[Mu-deok] Is the person
who shifted my father's soul

01:15:21.767 --> 01:15:23.894
Jin Mu as in Cheonbugwan?

01:15:26.063 --> 01:15:28.440
Why is it you?
Why does it have to be you again?

01:15:28.524 --> 01:15:32.236
Are you certain that the ice stone
has truly been rid from this world?

01:15:32.319 --> 01:15:33.195
[Jin Mu] Hemp Master Lee ordered

01:15:33.278 --> 01:15:35.113
all of the mages
in Cheonbugwan to search for him.

01:15:35.197 --> 01:15:37.783
It must never be revealed
that they are soul shifters.
